WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.570
- So, Lamorne, you're from Chicago.

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.950
Do you ever get back
there to see your mom?

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.060
- I do, I do.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.250
I try to get back a couple times a year,

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.890
when things aren't so busy.

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.368
My mom is like my favorite.

00:00:11.368 --> 00:00:12.201
- Aww!

00:00:12.201 --> 00:00:13.034
- Yeah, she's the greatest human.

00:00:13.034 --> 00:00:14.090
- I hope my son says that!

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:15.847
- Yeah, well, you know.

00:00:15.847 --> 00:00:18.130
My mom is the best though.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.867
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:20.920
She's better than everybody's mom.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.435
- [Kelly] I love that!

00:00:22.435 --> 00:00:23.860
Why is she the best?

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.300
- She does things like...

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.640
I grew up to be a comedic
actor and performer,

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.890
and I had no idea that my mom was funny

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.663
until she started prank phone calling me.

00:00:31.663 --> 00:00:33.360
- [Kelly] Prank phone calling?

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.828
- I would go home to visit my mom,

00:00:34.828 --> 00:00:38.040
and my old bedroom is
right next door to hers,

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:39.370
and so I would get a phone call

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.370
with her name on it,

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.478
and it would go, "Hello?"

00:00:42.478 --> 00:00:44.430
- (laughs) What?

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.477
- Mom, what are you doing?

00:00:46.477 --> 00:00:48.429
"How do you know it's me?"

00:00:48.429 --> 00:00:49.262
(audience laughing)

00:00:49.262 --> 00:00:50.095
It's the future, mom.

00:00:50.095 --> 00:00:51.879
We've got caller ID now.

00:00:51.879 --> 00:00:52.712
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:52.712 --> 00:00:54.070
Yeah, that's how my mom is.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:55.363
- [Kelly] That's amazing.

